(2661861, 369800, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice solid, classic composition. Good detail. Nice lighting. The photo has a pleasing, serene, peaceful easy feeling, if that makes sense. Nice job.</td>', 'Nice solid, classic composition. Good detail. Nice lighting. The photo has a pleasing, serene, peaceful easy feeling, if that makes sense. Nice job.', '2006-07-26 05:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2661877, 369768, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea. A well lit, very sharp, vibrant presentation. I see where you''re going with the off centered comp, and slight negative space, but I get a slightly un balanced feel. I''m wondering if perhaps it is in a spot where (as far as the negative space) it is wanting either a little bit more, or a little bit less, to achieve a slightly stronger ''balance''. A good idea though, and technically well done.</td>', 'Very creative idea. A well lit, very sharp, vibrant presentation. I see where you''re going with the off centered comp, and slight negative space, but I get a slightly un balanced feel. I''m wondering if perhaps it is in a spot where (as far as the negative space) it is wanting either a little bit more, or a little bit less, to achieve a slightly stronger ''balance''. A good idea though, and technically well done.', '2006-07-26 05:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2661884, 368627, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice detail. Awesome capture. I have spent several long sessions trying to catch a decent shot of these guys, and have yet to even come close! So I applaud the effort it must of taken. Nice job :-)</td>', 'Nice detail. Awesome capture. I have spent several long sessions trying to catch a decent shot of these guys, and have yet to even come close! So I applaud the effort it must of taken. Nice job :-)', '2006-07-26 05:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
