(2662669, 367111, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal line of the grass. Great sense of composition. The focus on the frog is perfect, with nice detailing.  There seems to be a bit of compression of the yellow on the edge of the grass. Maybe it''s my monitor. All in all, a well done image. 8</td>', 'I like the diagonal line of the grass. Great sense of composition. The focus on the frog is perfect, with nice detailing.  There seems to be a bit of compression of the yellow on the edge of the grass. Maybe it''s my monitor. All in all, a well done image. 8', '2006-07-26 10:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662671, 369007, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF but it seems "chopped off" with the crop you chose. I like the use of negative space but maybe if you shot from a different perspective??</td>', 'Nice DOF but it seems "chopped off" with the crop you chose. I like the use of negative space but maybe if you shot from a different perspective??', '2006-07-26 10:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662681, 367008, 15711, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the sense of background here. Just a close up of a face. The light below her eye is a tad too harsh for my taste. The eye is well focused and clear in the shot but I think that "hot spot" hurts it.</td>', 'I don''t get the sense of background here. Just a close up of a face. The light below her eye is a tad too harsh for my taste. The eye is well focused and clear in the shot but I think that "hot spot" hurts it.', '2006-07-26 10:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662686, 369812, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love how those little tendrils of plants just find another thing to cling onto and grow with. I''d crop that leaf to the left, so that you just see the edge and the subject isn''t so centered. It would make a cool square crop image.</td>', 'I love how those little tendrils of plants just find another thing to cling onto and grow with. I''d crop that leaf to the left, so that you just see the edge and the subject isn''t so centered. It would make a cool square crop image.', '2006-07-26 10:05:03.000000', NULL, 1);
