(2662690, 369126, 15711, '<td valign="top">Looks like something under a microscope. I sense that this is all done with post editing, but I could be wrong. I like the abstract quality.</td>', 'Looks like something under a microscope. I sense that this is all done with post editing, but I could be wrong. I like the abstract quality.', '2006-07-26 10:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662697, 369447, 46371, '<td valign="top">THIS IS SOMETHING I WOULD NOT EXPECT. BLUE WATER, BLUE SKY? RED PILLARS?</td>', 'THIS IS SOMETHING I WOULD NOT EXPECT. BLUE WATER, BLUE SKY? RED PILLARS?', '2006-07-26 10:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662706, 366999, 46371, '<td valign="top">THATS COOL AND TOUGH.8</td>', 'THATS COOL AND TOUGH.8', '2006-07-26 10:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662709, 369822, 46371, '<td valign="top">LITTLE SOFT ON FOCUS, BUT MABY IT SHOULD BE! NICE COLOR MATCH.</td>', 'LITTLE SOFT ON FOCUS, BUT MABY IT SHOULD BE! NICE COLOR MATCH.', '2006-07-26 10:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662714, 369540, 36382, '<td valign="top">Great idea  could be a bit sharper</td>', 'Great idea  could be a bit sharper', '2006-07-26 10:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662716, 369848, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think you missed the mark on this one.  IT needed to be a colored subject with the same color as the background. I''m just not seeing that in this image. I''d have one color in the glass, off center it with some negative space to one side and put it in front of a mat board of the same color.</td>', 'I think you missed the mark on this one.  IT needed to be a colored subject with the same color as the background. I''m just not seeing that in this image. I''d have one color in the glass, off center it with some negative space to one side and put it in front of a mat board of the same color.', '2006-07-26 10:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662717, 367234, 15711, '<td valign="top">I get the sense of a macro of a flower with a dark green background, more than the bee as the subject and the flower as the background.  There isn''t enough perspective for the flower to be a true background for me.</td>', 'I get the sense of a macro of a flower with a dark green background, more than the bee as the subject and the flower as the background.  There isn''t enough perspective for the flower to be a true background for me.', '2006-07-26 10:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662720, 368945, 46371, '<td valign="top">LASER? FREAKY, LIKE IT.</td>', 'LASER? FREAKY, LIKE IT.', '2006-07-26 10:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662724, 369227, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pretty and simple. (mine is similar - just a diff. color) ROFL. My only nitpick is the centering of it, even though you have more of the background at the top. I''d like it better off to one corner with more of the yellow background but that''s just me. 7</td>', 'Pretty and simple. (mine is similar - just a diff. color) ROFL. My only nitpick is the centering of it, even though you have more of the background at the top. I''d like it better off to one corner with more of the yellow background but that''s just me. 7', '2006-07-26 10:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662725, 369344, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE -  I see we had a similar idea. ;~D Nice crop and the negative space is good. I might do some burn on the the green veins for a bit of dimension.</td>', 'HEE -  I see we had a similar idea. ;~D Nice crop and the negative space is good. I might do some burn on the the green veins for a bit of dimension.', '2006-07-26 10:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662730, 367900, 15711, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but I like this, although I don''t truly think of the grass as background. I just think of all of it as the foreground. It''s pretty and I like the diagonal sense of the grass though.</td>', 'I don''t know why, but I like this, although I don''t truly think of the grass as background. I just think of all of it as the foreground. It''s pretty and I like the diagonal sense of the grass though.', '2006-07-26 10:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662732, 367622, 15711, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF.  Cute little guy.  This is pretty darn good.</td>', 'Excellent DOF.  Cute little guy.  This is pretty darn good.', '2006-07-26 10:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662733, 369874, 46371, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL, JUST BEAUTIFUL!!!</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL, JUST BEAUTIFUL!!!', '2006-07-26 10:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662734, 367256, 15711, '<td valign="top">Remove the date from the image. It needs to be shot from a different perspective so that there is a true background. AS it is, the pod of the flower is the subject and the background is brown.</td>', 'Remove the date from the image. It needs to be shot from a different perspective so that there is a true background. AS it is, the pod of the flower is the subject and the background is brown.', '2006-07-26 10:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662736, 368915, 46371, '<td valign="top">WISH IT WAS SHARPER, NICE EYES ON THAT HOPPER.</td>', 'WISH IT WAS SHARPER, NICE EYES ON THAT HOPPER.', '2006-07-26 10:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662738, 367120, 15711, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Love the deep emerald tones of the background.  Nice DOF - the diagonal sense of the grass with the water droplets is really good. The light is a tad harsh on the upper left part of the stalk.</td>', 'Excellent. Love the deep emerald tones of the background.  Nice DOF - the diagonal sense of the grass with the water droplets is really good. The light is a tad harsh on the upper left part of the stalk.', '2006-07-26 10:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662740, 368248, 46371, '<td valign="top">AND A SLIVER OF A MOON.NICE.</td>', 'AND A SLIVER OF A MOON.NICE.', '2006-07-26 10:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662742, 367256, 54728, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve got to figure out a way to get rid of that red date on your photos.  It is really distracting and kinda spoils it. Otherwise, the photo is allright.  Try to play around with composition, don''t automatically place the bud front and centre.  Experiment to find more exciting viewpoints.</td>', 'I think you''ve got to figure out a way to get rid of that red date on your photos.  It is really distracting and kinda spoils it. Otherwise, the photo is allright.  Try to play around with composition, don''t automatically place the bud front and centre.  Experiment to find more exciting viewpoints.', '2006-07-26 10:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662745, 369124, 15711, '<td valign="top">HA HA HA HA How funny. Love his camouflage. My only issue with this is that I don''t sense much background. I just see the foreground with the frog in the dirt. Nice DOF, but not alot of perspective. Still, well composed and I LOVE his expression. The light on his face is a tad hot on the upper left.</td>', 'HA HA HA HA How funny. Love his camouflage. My only issue with this is that I don''t sense much background. I just see the foreground with the frog in the dirt. Nice DOF, but not alot of perspective. Still, well composed and I LOVE his expression. The light on his face is a tad hot on the upper left.', '2006-07-26 10:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662748, 369767, 15711, '<td valign="top">Hard to believe a plastic fork could be so artful. I like the graphic sense of it. Nicely composed and quite contemporary. 7</td>', 'Hard to believe a plastic fork could be so artful. I like the graphic sense of it. Nicely composed and quite contemporary. 7', '2006-07-26 10:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662752, 367181, 46371, '<td valign="top">NICE JOB. WAS THIS TAKEN WITHOUT A TRIPOD? GREAT BLURING OF THE BACKGROUND, JUST NEEDS A LITTLE SHARPER FOCUS.</td>', 'NICE JOB. WAS THIS TAKEN WITHOUT A TRIPOD? GREAT BLURING OF THE BACKGROUND, JUST NEEDS A LITTLE SHARPER FOCUS.', '2006-07-26 10:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662755, 368985, 15711, '<td valign="top">COOL. If I were to change anything, I''d way off center the glass with the fish.  As it is, it has that sense of bullseye centering, although the fish is to the left. I like the idea of it. I might even like it from farther away with the whole stem of the wine glass in the shot with lots of negative space to the right. I love he''s looking right at you.</td>', 'COOL. If I were to change anything, I''d way off center the glass with the fish.  As it is, it has that sense of bullseye centering, although the fish is to the left. I like the idea of it. I might even like it from farther away with the whole stem of the wine glass in the shot with lots of negative space to the right. I love he''s looking right at you.', '2006-07-26 10:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662762, 369084, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, which alot of these shots don''t have.  This has a true background. Nice DOF. Love the simplicity and the water on the apples.  Nicely composed with good use of negative space. 7</td>', 'Nice perspective, which alot of these shots don''t have.  This has a true background. Nice DOF. Love the simplicity and the water on the apples.  Nicely composed with good use of negative space. 7', '2006-07-26 10:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662764, 369859, 54728, '<td valign="top">that is one frightening bug!  It would be a great photo to put in a book about spiders.  Kids love reading things like that.  Good focus and dynamic picture.</td>', 'that is one frightening bug!  It would be a great photo to put in a book about spiders.  Kids love reading things like that.  Good focus and dynamic picture.', '2006-07-26 10:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662765, 368457, 46371, '<td valign="top">IF THIS SHOT CAME OUT A BIT SHARPER, WINNER!!DO THEY HAVE RED LIPS OR TOUNG?7</td>', 'IF THIS SHOT CAME OUT A BIT SHARPER, WINNER!!DO THEY HAVE RED LIPS OR TOUNG?7', '2006-07-26 10:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662771, 369622, 15711, '<td valign="top">This suffers from the deadly target bullseye centering. I''d have much more negative space to the right. Love the DOF and the focus is great.  I love green, don''t you?</td>', 'This suffers from the deadly target bullseye centering. I''d have much more negative space to the right. Love the DOF and the focus is great.  I love green, don''t you?', '2006-07-26 10:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662774, 369096, 46371, '<td valign="top">I AM LIKEING SO MANY OF THESE SHOTS AND THIS IS ONE OF THEM. GREAT COLORS.8</td>', 'I AM LIKEING SO MANY OF THESE SHOTS AND THIS IS ONE OF THEM. GREAT COLORS.8', '2006-07-26 10:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662777, 368369, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is lovely with all the green, but I don''t have a true sense of background. This is more like a closeup and everything is in the foreground.  Having said that, I''d also have the tomato less centered in the shot with more negative space to one side. The lighting has created a "hot spot" right in the middle of it as well. The focus is great and the detail on the leaf is excellent. Hope you find this helpful.</td>', 'This is lovely with all the green, but I don''t have a true sense of background. This is more like a closeup and everything is in the foreground.  Having said that, I''d also have the tomato less centered in the shot with more negative space to one side. The lighting has created a "hot spot" right in the middle of it as well. The focus is great and the detail on the leaf is excellent. Hope you find this helpful.', '2006-07-26 10:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2662782, 369465, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I love tomatoes. The lighting creates a halo around where the fruit fell off of the vine. I think I''d like a tad different perspective but that''s just me. 7</td>', 'Very pretty. I love tomatoes. The lighting creates a halo around where the fruit fell off of the vine. I think I''d like a tad different perspective but that''s just me. 7', '2006-07-26 10:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
