(2662844, 369853, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is lovely. I always appreciate duplicity in a shot. Maybe center the flowers a bit more "off," so they arenit'' in the dead middle of the shot, but I love the warm tones and the way you did it.</td>', 'This is lovely. I always appreciate duplicity in a shot. Maybe center the flowers a bit more "off," so they arenit'' in the dead middle of the shot, but I love the warm tones and the way you did it.', '2006-07-26 10:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
