(2664170, 369872, 58469, '<td valign="top">Pretty good picture of a grasshopper. I don''t think they are generally a very cool or attractive bug though... as far as bugs go. Great job with the focus.</td>', 'Pretty good picture of a grasshopper. I don''t think they are generally a very cool or attractive bug though... as far as bugs go. Great job with the focus.', '2006-07-26 15:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664171, 369465, 52713, '<td valign="top">great red saturation!</td>', 'great red saturation!', '2006-07-26 15:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664173, 367008, 52549, '<td valign="top">The colour of the eye is lost in the darkness. Pity.</td>', 'The colour of the eye is lost in the darkness. Pity.', '2006-07-26 15:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664176, 367008, 62095, '<td valign="top">Just a bit too dark in the eye area really for my liking.</td>', 'Just a bit too dark in the eye area really for my liking.', '2006-07-26 15:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664177, 369227, 52713, '<td valign="top">great yellow and just enough contrast</td>', 'great yellow and just enough contrast', '2006-07-26 15:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664178, 369720, 58469, '<td valign="top">For an image with so little color, the texture or compostion of the image have to be very interesting to keep a persons mind on an image. The composition isn''t bad, but there isn''t anything in the image that stands out. It fits the challenge, but for me, it doesn''t go past that or reach it''s full potential.</td>', 'For an image with so little color, the texture or compostion of the image have to be very interesting to keep a persons mind on an image. The composition isn''t bad, but there isn''t anything in the image that stands out. It fits the challenge, but for me, it doesn''t go past that or reach it''s full potential.', '2006-07-26 15:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664179, 369720, 52713, '<td valign="top">too over exposed in the light areas</td>', 'too over exposed in the light areas', '2006-07-26 15:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664182, 369280, 52713, '<td valign="top">good job going for the DNMC</td>', 'good job going for the DNMC', '2006-07-26 15:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664183, 369255, 30214, '<td valign="top">you are my soulmate (in this challenge, at least :))</td>', 'you are my soulmate (in this challenge, at least :))', '2006-07-26 15:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664185, 368863, 52713, '<td valign="top">too much noise, I am guessing camera phone.</td>', 'too much noise, I am guessing camera phone.', '2006-07-26 15:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664186, 369025, 58469, '<td valign="top">The quality of the image itself seems a little bit low to me. Looking at the picture itself, I like the color and the composition.</td>', 'The quality of the image itself seems a little bit low to me. Looking at the picture itself, I like the color and the composition.', '2006-07-26 15:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664187, 368253, 52713, '<td valign="top">I hope you are going for the brown</td>', 'I hope you are going for the brown', '2006-07-26 15:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664188, 369874, 58469, '<td valign="top">I like green, and the eye is very captivating. I find the material a litte bit distracting.</td>', 'I like green, and the eye is very captivating. I find the material a litte bit distracting.', '2006-07-26 15:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664189, 368586, 58469, '<td valign="top">Pleasant, cool image. Well executed, Good job.</td>', 'Pleasant, cool image. Well executed, Good job.', '2006-07-26 15:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664192, 369126, 58469, '<td valign="top">Kind of has a cool psychedelic/abstract feel to it. Good job.</td>', 'Kind of has a cool psychedelic/abstract feel to it. Good job.', '2006-07-26 15:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664194, 369617, 58469, '<td valign="top">I love the focus on this image. Might be a bit overprocessed, but overall, I really like it.</td>', 'I love the focus on this image. Might be a bit overprocessed, but overall, I really like it.', '2006-07-26 15:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664200, 369653, 58469, '<td valign="top">As far as the subject is concerned, IMO, the nastiness of the bug outweighs the coolness of seeing him that close. Some bugs are more photogenic than others. This guy is on the bottom of the list.</td>', 'As far as the subject is concerned, IMO, the nastiness of the bug outweighs the coolness of seeing him that close. Some bugs are more photogenic than others. This guy is on the bottom of the list.', '2006-07-26 15:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664207, 369302, 70, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting entry. It''s leaning a little more towards digital art than photography for me, just because it looks like it''s been rather processed. I like the patterns and the arrangement. I also like the colors because I''m partial to blues and purples but I''m also kind of curious what it would look like in warmer tones (yellows/oranges, etc) since that''s what we typically see for pasta.</td>', 'This is an interesting entry. It''s leaning a little more towards digital art than photography for me, just because it looks like it''s been rather processed. I like the patterns and the arrangement. I also like the colors because I''m partial to blues and purples but I''m also kind of curious what it would look like in warmer tones (yellows/oranges, etc) since that''s what we typically see for pasta.', '2006-07-26 15:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664209, 369764, 58469, '<td valign="top">Nice. Great composition and a good idea. Well executed. That being said, something about te processing of the image doesn''t seem quite right. It''s almost like the head is a bit OOF, bt the body isn''t I don''t understand it. perhaps it was in the compression or something. I like it.</td>', 'Nice. Great composition and a good idea. Well executed. That being said, something about te processing of the image doesn''t seem quite right. It''s almost like the head is a bit OOF, bt the body isn''t I don''t understand it. perhaps it was in the compression or something. I like it.', '2006-07-26 15:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664210, 368905, 58469, '<td valign="top">I like the lines and the neagive space. Great job.</td>', 'I like the lines and the neagive space. Great job.', '2006-07-26 15:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664212, 368968, 70, '<td valign="top">Oh my. Surely they are only hugging, right? Like pals? Nicely camouflauged against each other and the background, although the overall photo quality seems lacking a bit.</td>', 'Oh my. Surely they are only hugging, right? Like pals? Nicely camouflauged against each other and the background, although the overall photo quality seems lacking a bit.', '2006-07-26 15:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664216, 368012, 70, '<td valign="top">Neat colors. I think I''d prefer a touch more room at the top so that the end of the pepper dosen''t feel so cramped. Good detail.</td>', 'Neat colors. I think I''d prefer a touch more room at the top so that the end of the pepper dosen''t feel so cramped. Good detail.', '2006-07-26 15:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664220, 366483, 58469, '<td valign="top">nice picture. Very pleasant. It''s good to seem some orange on orange in the challenge. Stands out in that respect.</td>', 'nice picture. Very pleasant. It''s good to seem some orange on orange in the challenge. Stands out in that respect.', '2006-07-26 15:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664226, 369670, 58469, '<td valign="top">Hehe, I really like this. Probably would have done well in the gold challenge too. Love the curve and the metalic feel of the whole image. well done.</td>', 'Hehe, I really like this. Probably would have done well in the gold challenge too. Love the curve and the metalic feel of the whole image. well done.', '2006-07-26 15:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664228, 369096, 70, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and good separation of subject from background. I think it would have been nice if you could have blurred out that little bit of texture in the bottom right corner as I find it minorly distracting. I also think I might have preferred the green leaves left out but maybe that would be too boring.</td>', 'Nice colors and good separation of subject from background. I think it would have been nice if you could have blurred out that little bit of texture in the bottom right corner as I find it minorly distracting. I also think I might have preferred the green leaves left out but maybe that would be too boring.', '2006-07-26 15:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664235, 369459, 70, '<td valign="top">Colors indeed. I''m not sure I''d consider this to be meeting the challenge as it''s not really a color on a background of the same color as much as it''s just every color and pattern imaginable, everywhere. <br/> <br/>From a technical standpoint, this feels something like a crop of a snapshot. The sides have been trimmed very close to the arms, but a spare arm is left in the background. And...the head! Kind of an awkard place to chop off the photo.</td>', 'Colors indeed. I''m not sure I''d consider this to be meeting the challenge as it''s not really a color on a background of the same color as much as it''s just every color and pattern imaginable, everywhere.  From a technical standpoint, this feels something like a crop of a snapshot. The sides have been trimmed very close to the arms, but a spare arm is left in the background. And...the head! Kind of an awkard place to chop off the photo.', '2006-07-26 15:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664238, 367139, 70, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat composition and I love the color effects of the stacked cases. For me, though, this doesn''t really meet the challenge as the background is an entirely different color, not the same color as the subject.</td>', 'This is a really neat composition and I love the color effects of the stacked cases. For me, though, this doesn''t really meet the challenge as the background is an entirely different color, not the same color as the subject.', '2006-07-26 15:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664239, 367288, 58469, '<td valign="top">I know you might not be getting a ton of high scores on this one, but I love it. Great job!</td>', 'I know you might not be getting a ton of high scores on this one, but I love it. Great job!', '2006-07-26 15:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664244, 367622, 70, '<td valign="top">Ooh, neat. I love the DOF on the frog. I am slightly bothered by the fact that the upper leaf is also in focus though as it pulls my eye away from the subject. Good detail on the frog and nice catchlight in his eye.</td>', 'Ooh, neat. I love the DOF on the frog. I am slightly bothered by the fact that the upper leaf is also in focus though as it pulls my eye away from the subject. Good detail on the frog and nice catchlight in his eye.', '2006-07-26 15:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664247, 369345, 58469, '<td valign="top">That''s a model, isn''t it?</td>', 'That''s a model, isn''t it?', '2006-07-26 15:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664248, 369872, 70, '<td valign="top">Very neat closeup! I''m curious what he''s sitting on...looks kind of like a napkin. Excellent meeting of challenge.</td>', 'Very neat closeup! I''m curious what he''s sitting on...looks kind of like a napkin. Excellent meeting of challenge.', '2006-07-26 15:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664250, 369287, 40580, '<td valign="top">I am amazed by the emotion in this picture.  I think it''s a very powerful shot.  Nothing to improve.</td>', 'I am amazed by the emotion in this picture.  I think it''s a very powerful shot.  Nothing to improve.', '2006-07-26 15:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664254, 369887, 70, '<td valign="top">I think this is an interesting composition and a nice pattern out of something we might otherwise miss. Unfortunately though, it lacks a bit of punch...something to make it stand out or really create interest.</td>', 'I think this is an interesting composition and a nice pattern out of something we might otherwise miss. Unfortunately though, it lacks a bit of punch...something to make it stand out or really create interest.', '2006-07-26 15:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664260, 367205, 70, '<td valign="top">Great detail for a fish which are often hard to capture without motion blur. I like the subtle patterns of the background, too. Subject is a little too centered for me, though.</td>', 'Great detail for a fish which are often hard to capture without motion blur. I like the subtle patterns of the background, too. Subject is a little too centered for me, though.', '2006-07-26 15:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664262, 369124, 70, '<td valign="top">Interesting muse. :) Well camouflauged and good detail.</td>', 'Interesting muse. :) Well camouflauged and good detail.', '2006-07-26 15:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664312, 369340, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Wonderful exposure and lighting.  Great detail in the fern leaves.  In the top 10 for me.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Wonderful exposure and lighting.  Great detail in the fern leaves.  In the top 10 for me.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-07-26 16:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664323, 369304, 30049, '<td valign="top">This has a vintage still life feel to it with a fun, unique twist.  Well done.</td>', 'This has a vintage still life feel to it with a fun, unique twist.  Well done.', '2006-07-26 16:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664326, 368913, 30049, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet creative.  I can definitely feel ''Yoga'' here.  You did a nice job of lighting your subject.  Good luck.</td>', 'Simple, yet creative.  I can definitely feel ''Yoga'' here.  You did a nice job of lighting your subject.  Good luck.', '2006-07-26 16:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664331, 368982, 52549, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Love the lime green colour.</td>', 'Great idea. Love the lime green colour.', '2006-07-26 16:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664340, 369803, 30049, '<td valign="top">When you''re looking for one of these fellas you can''t find em!  ;^)  We''ve had some big green tomato worms in our garden recently, but not one for at least a week (I''ve looked!).<br/> <br/>Great choice for this challenge.  The ''L'' shape helps the composition tremendously and you''ve nailed the focus and exposure.  Good luck!</td>', 'When you''re looking for one of these fellas you can''t find em!  ;^)  We''ve had some big green tomato worms in our garden recently, but not one for at least a week (I''ve looked!). Great choice for this challenge.  The ''L'' shape helps the composition tremendously and you''ve nailed the focus and exposure.  Good luck!', '2006-07-26 16:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664341, 366430, 52549, '<td valign="top">Certainly looks like molten something..... Beautiful colours and lines.</td>', 'Certainly looks like molten something..... Beautiful colours and lines.', '2006-07-26 16:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664344, 369105, 52549, '<td valign="top">Original idea. Beautiful textures and colours.</td>', 'Original idea. Beautiful textures and colours.', '2006-07-26 16:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664347, 369573, 52549, '<td valign="top">Simple but subtle.</td>', 'Simple but subtle.', '2006-07-26 16:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664349, 369637, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great eye to see this shot!  It''s one of those images where you go "yes" once you see it.  Perfect for this challenge.  Kudos to you for the vision and the ability to capture this image.  My top pick for the challenge.</td>', 'Great eye to see this shot!  It''s one of those images where you go "yes" once you see it.  Perfect for this challenge.  Kudos to you for the vision and the ability to capture this image.  My top pick for the challenge.', '2006-07-26 16:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664351, 369255, 52549, '<td valign="top">Caterpillars seem the rage at the moment, but they make such good subjects.<br/>Love the shades of green and the sharpness on the caterpillars face (at least I hope it''s its face ;-)</td>', 'Caterpillars seem the rage at the moment, but they make such good subjects.Love the shades of green and the sharpness on the caterpillars face (at least I hope it''s its face ;-)', '2006-07-26 16:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664353, 369155, 52549, '<td valign="top">Good idea - love the colour.</td>', 'Good idea - love the colour.', '2006-07-26 16:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664355, 369803, 48541, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually one for bug photos but I can''t stop staring at the eyes.  The clarity is great and it creeps me out.  This is my highest rating for a nature/bug/plant/flower photo since the flower challenge. 8.</td>', 'I''m not usually one for bug photos but I can''t stop staring at the eyes.  The clarity is great and it creeps me out.  This is my highest rating for a nature/bug/plant/flower photo since the flower challenge. 8.', '2006-07-26 16:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664357, 368541, 48541, '<td valign="top">I wish more of the sweets were in focus but I really liked your idea. 7.</td>', 'I wish more of the sweets were in focus but I really liked your idea. 7.', '2006-07-26 16:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664360, 367532, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Nice job of keeping enough detail in the flower petals without losing them to the matching background.  Nice, soft, clean image.  Should do well with this.</td>', 'I like this.  Nice job of keeping enough detail in the flower petals without losing them to the matching background.  Nice, soft, clean image.  Should do well with this.', '2006-07-26 16:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664362, 369717, 52549, '<td valign="top">Talk about camouflage ;-) Millie is one pretty lady.</td>', 'Talk about camouflage ;-) Millie is one pretty lady.', '2006-07-26 16:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2664371, 369174, 52549, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colour and texture. The bright patch at the bottom left hand corner is slightly distracting.</td>', 'Beautiful colour and texture. The bright patch at the bottom left hand corner is slightly distracting.', '2006-07-26 16:15:16.000000', NULL, 1);
