(2666378, 369630, 39684, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.Very pretty shades of blue. Maybe needs to be a bit more centered (if I had to be picky).</td>', 'I like this shot.Very pretty shades of blue. Maybe needs to be a bit more centered (if I had to be picky).', '2006-07-27 01:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
