(2667653, 369726, 60495, '<td valign="top">Good job that looks like a tough shot to get the lighting right on each flower but you hit it preety close, very nice</td>', 'Good job that looks like a tough shot to get the lighting right on each flower but you hit it preety close, very nice', '2006-07-27 12:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2667657, 369726, 19944, '<td valign="top">Great idea and nicely shot with great colors..  If I had to find something to critique, I would say that I would probably center the flowers in each quadrant, or some sort of other symmetrical arrangement.  As it is now, the red rose seems to be drifting to the lower right, the <strike>crysasanthumum</strike> white flower to the lower left, orange bottom right and the yellow seems centered.  It just seems off balance.</td>', 'Great idea and nicely shot with great colors..  If I had to find something to critique, I would say that I would probably center the flowers in each quadrant, or some sort of other symmetrical arrangement.  As it is now, the red rose seems to be drifting to the lower right, the crysasanthumum white flower to the lower left, orange bottom right and the yellow seems centered.  It just seems off balance.', '2006-07-27 12:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2667658, 369280, 58840, '<td valign="top">DNMC!  :)</td>', 'DNMC!  :)', '2006-07-27 12:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2667659, 367288, 19944, '<td valign="top">I would guess I''d say that the sense of motion makes this better than just a toy car sitting on orange paper.  Also, there seems to be a shadow of some sort along the top edge on the right that should have been cropped out.</td>', 'I would guess I''d say that the sense of motion makes this better than just a toy car sitting on orange paper.  Also, there seems to be a shadow of some sort along the top edge on the right that should have been cropped out.', '2006-07-27 13:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2667662, 369132, 19944, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and color.  I like the off centered composition as well.</td>', 'Very nice lighting and color.  I like the off centered composition as well.', '2006-07-27 13:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
