(2667676, 367256, 19944, '<td valign="top">Tip...turn off the date/time stamp on your camera<br/> <br/>To be brutally honest, this shot is fairly mundane, and will probably hold little interest for most.  Perhaps a shot from the side, with other green plants in the background and a shallow depth of field would be more captivating.  Also think about bumpin the saturation and sharpening somewhat.</td>', 'Tip...turn off the date/time stamp on your camera To be brutally honest, this shot is fairly mundane, and will probably hold little interest for most.  Perhaps a shot from the side, with other green plants in the background and a shallow depth of field would be more captivating.  Also think about bumpin the saturation and sharpening somewhat.', '2006-07-27 13:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
