(2668132, 368991, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro, the grass bokeh and composition really makes this photo.  Well done!  <br/> <br/>I though he was missing an antenna at first, but looks like it just disappears from the DOF.</td>', 'Very nice macro, the grass bokeh and composition really makes this photo.  Well done!   I though he was missing an antenna at first, but looks like it just disappears from the DOF.', '2006-07-27 15:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
