(2668144, 369593, 42100, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph.  Some pretty serious shallow DOF, very cool except for the kind of hard edge created just under his feet that goes across the width of the frame.  The color and sharpness of the insect are awesome.</td>', 'Nice photograph.  Some pretty serious shallow DOF, very cool except for the kind of hard edge created just under his feet that goes across the width of the frame.  The color and sharpness of the insect are awesome.', '2006-07-27 15:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
