(2668196, 367205, 53690, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  What a pretty fish!  Those blues work well together.  I think I would prefer the fish to be a bit less centered, but this works well too.</td>', 'Nice capture.  What a pretty fish!  Those blues work well together.  I think I would prefer the fish to be a bit less centered, but this works well too.', '2006-07-27 15:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
