(2668228, 369407, 53690, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Lot''s of lovely blue tones to look at.  I really like the composition.  The second "thing" (for lack of a better word) in the bottom left really balances the pic well.  I also like the way the cables seem to drift off into nothing as the color deepens.</td>', 'Very cool.  Lot''s of lovely blue tones to look at.  I really like the composition.  The second "thing" (for lack of a better word) in the bottom left really balances the pic well.  I also like the way the cables seem to drift off into nothing as the color deepens.', '2006-07-27 15:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668229, 369882, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photograph with the composition.  The bottom of the peppers disappear into the background a bit, and the bottom pepper seems in the shadow of the upper one.  Maybe some more lighting from bottom or something?</td>', 'Very interesting photograph with the composition.  The bottom of the peppers disappear into the background a bit, and the bottom pepper seems in the shadow of the upper one.  Maybe some more lighting from bottom or something?', '2006-07-27 15:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
