(2668275, 369293, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice light and shading in this, like the muted greens also.  A little bit on the uninteresting side, compositionally.</td>', 'Very nice light and shading in this, like the muted greens also.  A little bit on the uninteresting side, compositionally.', '2006-07-27 15:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
