(2670938, 369822, 60799, '<td valign="top">aaaaawww.... isn''t he cute!<br/> <br/>I like the softness of this photo.  The title is especially funny too, as everytime I stick a camera in our dogs faces they do the same thing.  Nice approach to the challenge.</td>', 'aaaaawww.... isn''t he cute! I like the softness of this photo.  The title is especially funny too, as everytime I stick a camera in our dogs faces they do the same thing.  Nice approach to the challenge.', '2006-07-28 10:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
