(2670943, 367472, 62249, '<td valign="top">The bright area in the lower part of the leftmost flower isn''t quite in focus, and there''s a distracting dark bit of something on the fabric in the same area. But overall it''s a nice idea for a still life, and the fabric and folds are nicely exposed.</td>', 'The bright area in the lower part of the leftmost flower isn''t quite in focus, and there''s a distracting dark bit of something on the fabric in the same area. But overall it''s a nice idea for a still life, and the fabric and folds are nicely exposed.', '2006-07-28 10:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
