(2671614, 369732, 30049, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet stunning!  Sometimes I think we all look too hard and miss the simple beauty right in front of us.  ;^)<br/> <br/>Lovely image for the challenge, and right on the money for meeting the theme.  Good composition and nice choice for DOF - sharp as a tack too!</td>', 'Simple, yet stunning!  Sometimes I think we all look too hard and miss the simple beauty right in front of us.  ;^) Lovely image for the challenge, and right on the money for meeting the theme.  Good composition and nice choice for DOF - sharp as a tack too!', '2006-07-28 14:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
