(2673726, 369255, 58469, '<td valign="top">Dude, I have a hard time getting past how disgusting and destructive these guys are. Texture of this guy is fairly interesting *shudder* But I would rather not have seen it. Technically, the photo seems well done with the highlights on his back being a possible exception. Might be a little too blown out.</td>', 'Dude, I have a hard time getting past how disgusting and destructive these guys are. Texture of this guy is fairly interesting *shudder* But I would rather not have seen it. Technically, the photo seems well done with the highlights on his back being a possible exception. Might be a little too blown out.', '2006-07-29 11:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2673729, 369771, 58469, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like there was some camera shake or something. I''m not sure what caused the problem exactly, but I don''t see anything that''s as sharp as I think it should be. Cool idea, and good texture of the shell though</td>', 'Almost looks like there was some camera shake or something. I''m not sure what caused the problem exactly, but I don''t see anything that''s as sharp as I think it should be. Cool idea, and good texture of the shell though', '2006-07-29 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
