(2673786, 369593, 58469, '<td valign="top">Love the spots. I think I would have liked to have seen a little bit of a wider DOF, but as someone that entered this challenge with a DOF about as thick as a hair, I''m not one to assume you had the right lighting conditions to do that =)</td>', 'Love the spots. I think I would have liked to have seen a little bit of a wider DOF, but as someone that entered this challenge with a DOF about as thick as a hair, I''m not one to assume you had the right lighting conditions to do that =)', '2006-07-29 12:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2673791, 366999, 58469, '<td valign="top">I like the eyes and the expression , except that the lips don''t seem to match the angry facial expression to me. Also, I see why you named it redhead, but it seems like with the angry red tones and an angry looking person, a better title might have been something that had to do with that. Although, I suppose redheads have a reputation of being angry sometimes, but for me at least, I tend to think of a fiery redheaded girl... In any case, this is still one of my favorites, good job.</td>', 'I like the eyes and the expression , except that the lips don''t seem to match the angry facial expression to me. Also, I see why you named it redhead, but it seems like with the angry red tones and an angry looking person, a better title might have been something that had to do with that. Although, I suppose redheads have a reputation of being angry sometimes, but for me at least, I tend to think of a fiery redheaded girl... In any case, this is still one of my favorites, good job.', '2006-07-29 12:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
