(2675372, 368586, 61318, '<td valign="top">fantastic...I can''t complain at all about this.<br/> <br/>however, I''ve got one suggestion that may have made this already stellar shot even better.<br/> <br/>adjust the lighting slightly so that the shadow of the blueberry isn''t competing with the splash for it''s place in the frame.  that is to say, the shadow could easily be an element all its own here, but it''s partially masked by the splash.  I think ideally you could have three independent and equally interesting elements at play.</td>', 'fantastic...I can''t complain at all about this. however, I''ve got one suggestion that may have made this already stellar shot even better. adjust the lighting slightly so that the shadow of the blueberry isn''t competing with the splash for it''s place in the frame.  that is to say, the shadow could easily be an element all its own here, but it''s partially masked by the splash.  I think ideally you could have three independent and equally interesting elements at play.', '2006-07-30 01:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
