(2679522, 369304, 60799, '<td valign="top">Really neat idea and pretty good execution.  The color is perfect and I like how you''ve let the apple turn a little brown (maybe it just happened cause you took too long though :) ).  What I don''t like though is the visible halo I can see around most of the outer edges of the apple (maybe 5 or 8 pixels out).  It seems that the background was <i>maybe</i> blurred in post?  Either way... I give a 9</td>', 'Really neat idea and pretty good execution.  The color is perfect and I like how you''ve let the apple turn a little brown (maybe it just happened cause you took too long though :) ).  What I don''t like though is the visible halo I can see around most of the outer edges of the apple (maybe 5 or 8 pixels out).  It seems that the background was maybe blurred in post?  Either way... I give a 9', '2006-07-31 11:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
