(2683579, 369693, 30049, '<td valign="top">Adorable shot of this baby bird, but where is the connection to the challenge?  I''m not seeing the ''Color on Color'' in this.  Sorry.  Good luck.</td>', 'Adorable shot of this baby bird, but where is the connection to the challenge?  I''m not seeing the ''Color on Color'' in this.  Sorry.  Good luck.', '2006-08-01 12:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
