(2683588, 368205, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a tough one.  I want to say it''s too dark, but then the subject is dark so it needs to be.  Hmmm.  The composition is fine.  I wish you could have gotten that back olive in focus with a deeper aperture.  Light green olives might have been a better choice?</td>', 'This is a tough one.  I want to say it''s too dark, but then the subject is dark so it needs to be.  Hmmm.  The composition is fine.  I wish you could have gotten that back olive in focus with a deeper aperture.  Light green olives might have been a better choice?', '2006-08-01 12:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2683592, 369258, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice natural color choice.  Works well for the challenge.  Compositionally, the image is going to take a hit for having the subject so centered.  What''s up with the ear tags?  Is this from a animal park or something...not that it matters, just curious.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice natural color choice.  Works well for the challenge.  Compositionally, the image is going to take a hit for having the subject so centered.  What''s up with the ear tags?  Is this from a animal park or something...not that it matters, just curious.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-01 12:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2683598, 369727, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute setup.  I wonder if you''ll actually fool anybody with that "butterfly"?  ;^)  The color shades are actually quite nice and this image stands a chance of doing well.  The border patrol going to get you tho!  Good luck.</td>', 'Cute setup.  I wonder if you''ll actually fool anybody with that "butterfly"?  ;^)  The color shades are actually quite nice and this image stands a chance of doing well.  The border patrol going to get you tho!  Good luck.', '2006-08-01 12:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2683601, 368457, 30049, '<td valign="top">Close, but no cigar.  Nice composition, but the image is a little over-exposed around the head of the mantis and not quite sharp enough to pull it off.  Best of luck to you.</td>', 'Close, but no cigar.  Nice composition, but the image is a little over-exposed around the head of the mantis and not quite sharp enough to pull it off.  Best of luck to you.', '2006-08-01 12:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
