(2684729, 369855, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, nice simple composition, and I like the overall ''smooth'' feel I get from the look of it. Very cool.</td>', 'Nice lighting, nice simple composition, and I like the overall ''smooth'' feel I get from the look of it. Very cool.', '2006-08-01 18:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
