(2684756, 367856, 3351, '<td valign="top">Too much going on.</td>', 'Too much going on.', '2006-08-01 19:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684759, 369246, 3351, '<td valign="top">Cool! What are those?</td>', 'Cool! What are those?', '2006-08-01 19:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684763, 367900, 3351, '<td valign="top">I like it. A new approach to green and nature shots.</td>', 'I like it. A new approach to green and nature shots.', '2006-08-01 19:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684780, 368177, 3351, '<td valign="top">Hot, but I would like it more if the bumper wasn''t cut off.</td>', 'Hot, but I would like it more if the bumper wasn''t cut off.', '2006-08-01 19:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684819, 369859, 70, '<td valign="top">Oh my. I hope this is a pet and not just something you find crawling in your yard. Nice shot and color on color but the background blowouts are a bit distracting.</td>', 'Oh my. I hope this is a pet and not just something you find crawling in your yard. Nice shot and color on color but the background blowouts are a bit distracting.', '2006-08-01 19:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684823, 369833, 70, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Very soothing colors and a neat but simple design.</td>', 'I really like this. Very soothing colors and a neat but simple design.', '2006-08-01 19:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684826, 369132, 70, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Love the dark red tones and the lighting. This would make a nice restaurant piece.</td>', 'Very nice. Love the dark red tones and the lighting. This would make a nice restaurant piece.', '2006-08-01 19:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684830, 367377, 70, '<td valign="top">The things you people will do for a challenge! :D The contrast with the eyes is just awesome. The crop feels a little bit awkward but I guess it works with the title. Nicely done.</td>', 'The things you people will do for a challenge! :D The contrast with the eyes is just awesome. The crop feels a little bit awkward but I guess it works with the title. Nicely done.', '2006-08-01 19:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684833, 367854, 70, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure how this meets the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not quite sure how this meets the challenge.', '2006-08-01 19:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684835, 367973, 70, '<td valign="top">Woah...gross AND cool!</td>', 'Woah...gross AND cool!', '2006-08-01 19:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684845, 369345, 70, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but I''m not sure I''m a fan of the execution. I am guessing this is a model? To be honest, I''m not really sure what''s going on here. Is that fog of some sort? The majority of the photo seems to be rather blurred/foggy and the headlights are kind of bright. The top third of the photo seems completely blown out.</td>', 'I like the idea but I''m not sure I''m a fan of the execution. I am guessing this is a model? To be honest, I''m not really sure what''s going on here. Is that fog of some sort? The majority of the photo seems to be rather blurred/foggy and the headlights are kind of bright. The top third of the photo seems completely blown out.', '2006-08-01 19:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684852, 369726, 70, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea. My only nitpick is that in something this geometric, I think it''s important that the flowers be centered and the red rose and white whatever (I''m no flower expert) are not. But a unique use of flowers!</td>', 'Very cool idea. My only nitpick is that in something this geometric, I think it''s important that the flowers be centered and the red rose and white whatever (I''m no flower expert) are not. But a unique use of flowers!', '2006-08-01 19:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684858, 367717, 70, '<td valign="top">Nice catch but doesn''t especially strike me as color on color.</td>', 'Nice catch but doesn''t especially strike me as color on color.', '2006-08-01 19:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684861, 369803, 70, '<td valign="top">Dang, check out all those crazy eyes! Great detail and very nice color on color.</td>', 'Dang, check out all those crazy eyes! Great detail and very nice color on color.', '2006-08-01 19:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684864, 369573, 70, '<td valign="top">I have to say, for what this shot consists of, it turned out pretty interesting. The grain of the marble is a tiny bit distracting but  I like the smoothness of the shallow DOF.</td>', 'I have to say, for what this shot consists of, it turned out pretty interesting. The grain of the marble is a tiny bit distracting but  I like the smoothness of the shallow DOF.', '2006-08-01 19:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684865, 369829, 3351, '<td valign="top">This is the most amazing bug/plant picture I have seen thus far, and probably ever on this site! Everything about this is perfect! 10!</td>', 'This is the most amazing bug/plant picture I have seen thus far, and probably ever on this site! Everything about this is perfect! 10!', '2006-08-01 19:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684868, 369345, 3351, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2006-08-01 19:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684874, 369548, 3351, '<td valign="top">Very cool, except for what appear to be small hairs in the water</td>', 'Very cool, except for what appear to be small hairs in the water', '2006-08-01 19:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684875, 369850, 3351, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2006-08-01 19:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684878, 368913, 3351, '<td valign="top">Cute title. I like it very much!</td>', 'Cute title. I like it very much!', '2006-08-01 19:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684881, 369853, 3351, '<td valign="top">This is great! A fresh idea for flower photography.</td>', 'This is great! A fresh idea for flower photography.', '2006-08-01 19:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684882, 369304, 70, '<td valign="top">This is really cool. I love the colors and the patern of the background. You need some orange juice on your apples so they don''t turn brown. ;)</td>', 'This is really cool. I love the colors and the patern of the background. You need some orange juice on your apples so they don''t turn brown. ;)', '2006-08-01 19:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684886, 369550, 3351, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! A much better choice for blue than many I have seen thus far. That sky is dazzling!</td>', 'Gorgeous! A much better choice for blue than many I have seen thus far. That sky is dazzling!', '2006-08-01 19:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684890, 369769, 3351, '<td valign="top">A cutie, but I am distracted by the handprints on the wall in the background.</td>', 'A cutie, but I am distracted by the handprints on the wall in the background.', '2006-08-01 19:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684895, 368960, 3351, '<td valign="top">Normally I don''t like the bright flash and blown out white, but this photo has the look of some fashion photography I have been seeing lately, and I think it really works here.</td>', 'Normally I don''t like the bright flash and blown out white, but this photo has the look of some fashion photography I have been seeing lately, and I think it really works here.', '2006-08-01 19:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684906, 369302, 3351, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what kind of post processing you have done here, but I don''t really like it. Was the pasta blue before you took the photo, or was all this done after? It is a cool idea, and a cool composition, though.</td>', 'I don''t know what kind of post processing you have done here, but I don''t really like it. Was the pasta blue before you took the photo, or was all this done after? It is a cool idea, and a cool composition, though.', '2006-08-01 19:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2684911, 367855, 3351, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2006-08-01 19:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
