(2685506, 368913, 53147, '<td valign="top">Nice clean shot. Glad you didnt pick a perfect banana as the few marks really add to the picture. Very nice. Bumping up.</td>', 'Nice clean shot. Glad you didnt pick a perfect banana as the few marks really add to the picture. Very nice. Bumping up.', '2006-08-01 22:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
