(2685514, 369803, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Beautiful detail and the colors are nice and subdued. Hope this does well for you and I will help out a bit. Bumping up.</td>', 'Great shot. Beautiful detail and the colors are nice and subdued. Hope this does well for you and I will help out a bit. Bumping up.', '2006-08-01 22:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
