(2685525, 367682, 53147, '<td valign="top">Quite the stare he has going on. Very nice shot, good colors and the blur of the pads frame him in quite well. Bumping up.</td>', 'Quite the stare he has going on. Very nice shot, good colors and the blur of the pads frame him in quite well. Bumping up.', '2006-08-01 22:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2685533, 369829, 53147, '<td valign="top">I think of all the bug shots I like this one the  best. I love that it is not green. Fantastic detail on the grasshopper and the plant that he is sitting on gives a great contrast of curves against the lines of the bug. Really well done. Bumping up - one of my top picks of this challenge. Back one more time to give you one more bump. Good luck tonight!<br/> <br/>Ok - back one last time and I can now bump you no further. You get my only ten on this challenge.</td>', 'I think of all the bug shots I like this one the  best. I love that it is not green. Fantastic detail on the grasshopper and the plant that he is sitting on gives a great contrast of curves against the lines of the bug. Really well done. Bumping up - one of my top picks of this challenge. Back one more time to give you one more bump. Good luck tonight! Ok - back one last time and I can now bump you no further. You get my only ten on this challenge.', '2006-08-01 22:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
