(2687492, 369287, 24454, '<td valign="top">This has a nice strong score -- but I would have sworn this one would be in the top 3 or 4.   You did an excellent job on this.  It''s such a powerful photo.   I think I told you I was one of your 19 10''s, but I want to tell you again how awesome I think this photo is!<br/> <br/></td>', 'This has a nice strong score -- but I would have sworn this one would be in the top 3 or 4.   You did an excellent job on this.  It''s such a powerful photo.   I think I told you I was one of your 19 10''s, but I want to tell you again how awesome I think this photo is! ', '2006-08-02 08:40:47.000000', NULL, 0),
