(2687881, 368985, 46885, '<td valign="top">It''s way too good for 32nd place. What a strange process this voting. I like the murkiness of the glass, the almost lost shape of the fish and the elegant chequered effect of lighting of glass and the background. My only grumble is that you don''t provide the details of the process: for those of us who learn they are important.</td>', 'It''s way too good for 32nd place. What a strange process this voting. I like the murkiness of the glass, the almost lost shape of the fish and the elegant chequered effect of lighting of glass and the background. My only grumble is that you don''t provide the details of the process: for those of us who learn they are important.', '2006-08-02 10:46:10.000000', NULL, 0),
