(2688019, 369769, 14620, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tinky2:</b></div><hr/><i> Beautiful!  Great portrait and well suited to the challenge, I think.  I am stumped by the offending comment. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Me too. <br/> <br/>Thanks for the great comments and feedback guys.<br/> <br/>And to be honest, I didn''t even notice the handprint behind her until after I had posted it.  Weird huh?  Just added a quirky little touch, I think.  And I suck at coming up with titles, so Freckle face was probably pushing it a bit. :-D<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by tinky2: Beautiful!  Great portrait and well suited to the challenge, I think.  I am stumped by the offending comment.   Me too.  Thanks for the great comments and feedback guys. And to be honest, I didn''t even notice the handprint behind her until after I had posted it.  Weird huh?  Just added a quirky little touch, I think.  And I suck at coming up with titles, so Freckle face was probably pushing it a bit. :-D', '2006-08-02 11:23:04.000000', NULL, 0),
