(2688060, 369407, 35602, '<td valign="top">I was curious when you posted to the Sony Alpha thread about using the camera for this challenge.  I am in the market to get one of these cameras, and the last thing to sell me on it is the images that are produced with it.  <br/>Your color is wonderful on this one, but I would like to see better focus.  The fact that you used iso 400 gives me a good idea of noise with this camera.  I don''t see any discernable noise, and given the exposure of the bridge, that is a good thing.  I do like the image, but I agree with the comments that the lower left is distracting, and I would have liked to see more of the bridge if possible.  Could you clone out the spire on the left?</td>', 'I was curious when you posted to the Sony Alpha thread about using the camera for this challenge.  I am in the market to get one of these cameras, and the last thing to sell me on it is the images that are produced with it.  Your color is wonderful on this one, but I would like to see better focus.  The fact that you used iso 400 gives me a good idea of noise with this camera.  I don''t see any discernable noise, and given the exposure of the bridge, that is a good thing.  I do like the image, but I agree with the comments that the lower left is distracting, and I would have liked to see more of the bridge if possible.  Could you clone out the spire on the left?', '2006-08-02 11:36:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2688066, 369084, 31403, '<td valign="top">48th!!!   I thought this was brilliant composition - really like it a lot.  Much higher that 48 in MY book!  ;-)</td>', '48th!!!   I thought this was brilliant composition - really like it a lot.  Much higher that 48 in MY book!  ;-)', '2006-08-02 11:40:11.000000', NULL, 0),
