(2688182, 367377, 57358, '<td valign="top">hmm... a few people have mentioned the shadow on his head, really, most of that is where the paint was too thin, I did the finishing up while he was standing, so I didn''t really notice the top of his head, lol, and then the shadow just happened to fall that way, so it was magnified...  oh well, guess I could''ve painted it more once I noticed, but I didn''t want to make it longer than it had to be.<br/> <br/>Thanks everyone for the comments, lol, and yeah he''s get a nice big bald head... perfect for painting</td>', 'hmm... a few people have mentioned the shadow on his head, really, most of that is where the paint was too thin, I did the finishing up while he was standing, so I didn''t really notice the top of his head, lol, and then the shadow just happened to fall that way, so it was magnified...  oh well, guess I could''ve painted it more once I noticed, but I didn''t want to make it longer than it had to be. Thanks everyone for the comments, lol, and yeah he''s get a nice big bald head... perfect for painting', '2006-08-02 12:19:47.000000', NULL, 0),
