(2695375, 369536, 40718, '<td valign="top">Well, I will ignore the crowd who says "white isn''t a color" (but you know there were a few...9 1s?, 13 2s? that''s hard to overcome)<br/> <br/>The picture is well done on its own merits.  Composition is excellent.  The crop is wonderful.  Off centered, full body, simple background, but small "props" to help provide context (the bag and stool).<br/> <br/>The white shirt looks like it''s a little too close to blowing for my comfort.  That''s my biggest criticism.  What killed you was the DNMC crowd.  I didn''t vote this picture, but even I would have been looking for a little more "color on color".  Don''t take the low score in this case as meaning the picture is poor.  It is excellent.</td>', 'Well, I will ignore the crowd who says "white isn''t a color" (but you know there were a few...9 1s?, 13 2s? that''s hard to overcome) The picture is well done on its own merits.  Composition is excellent.  The crop is wonderful.  Off centered, full body, simple background, but small "props" to help provide context (the bag and stool). The white shirt looks like it''s a little too close to blowing for my comfort.  That''s my biggest criticism.  What killed you was the DNMC crowd.  I didn''t vote this picture, but even I would have been looking for a little more "color on color".  Don''t take the low score in this case as meaning the picture is poor.  It is excellent.', '2006-08-04 14:15:39.000000', NULL, 0),
