(2768901, 369550, 22301, '<td valign="top">I have seen this several times and I just hink it is amazingly well done, I can''t really suggest an improvement, just wanted you to know I think its  beautiful.</td>', 'I have seen this several times and I just hink it is amazingly well done, I can''t really suggest an improvement, just wanted you to know I think its  beautiful.', '2006-08-28 20:20:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2769006, 369550, 40683, '<td valign="top">The richness of color in this image is simply arresting.   The strong diagonals along with the curves of the windblown fabrics provide a lot of visual interest to the composition.  I''ve looked through your portfolio and you have a really good eye for perspective.  Adding this to favorites!</td>', 'The richness of color in this image is simply arresting.   The strong diagonals along with the curves of the windblown fabrics provide a lot of visual interest to the composition.  I''ve looked through your portfolio and you have a really good eye for perspective.  Adding this to favorites!', '2006-08-28 21:00:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2778956, 367856, 40490, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a gorgeous shot, (I was looking through the Silhouettes score section.  I really like it.  I would have voted probably a 7-9.... the blue-berries in the background that are slightly faded keep it from being max... but I like it anyway :-)</td>', 'Wow, this is a gorgeous shot, (I was looking through the Silhouettes score section.  I really like it.  I would have voted probably a 7-9.... the blue-berries in the background that are slightly faded keep it from being max... but I like it anyway :-)', '2006-08-31 15:10:17.000000', NULL, 0),
