(2799400, 369874, 9285, '<td valign="top">An unfair comparision.. but I was trying to link this shot to the National Geographic shot... <br/> <br/>For an ethnic shot like this, I personnally would prefer a really harsh constrast and not a soft feel ..<br/> <br/>If you could have included a little of the scarf at the forehead, it''ll bring out the eyes more...<br/> <br/>Still a good shot for me.. 7 for score.. :)</td>', 'An unfair comparision.. but I was trying to link this shot to the National Geographic shot...  For an ethnic shot like this, I personnally would prefer a really harsh constrast and not a soft feel .. If you could have included a little of the scarf at the forehead, it''ll bring out the eyes more... Still a good shot for me.. 7 for score.. :)', '2006-09-05 04:35:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(2811174, 367875, 48389, '<td valign="top">Superb detail in the petals, the BG works well even though logically you''d think it wouldnt and the composition is great, well done :o)</td>', 'Superb detail in the petals, the BG works well even though logically you''d think it wouldnt and the composition is great, well done :o)', '2006-09-07 16:57:03.000000', NULL, 0),
