(4294226, 367875, 69008, '<td valign="top">I have been looking around in your portfolio, and find that you have a unique way of seeing things, and that you like macro a lot. This shot is very nice with the choice of background. You seem to have learned to pay attention to the background in your shots, as it was distracting in a lot of your earlier images. It''s getting much better as you grow with your camera hobby. This shot is an excellent study in texture and color, and composition. <br/> <br/></td>', 'I have been looking around in your portfolio, and find that you have a unique way of seeing things, and that you like macro a lot. This shot is very nice with the choice of background. You seem to have learned to pay attention to the background in your shots, as it was distracting in a lot of your earlier images. It''s getting much better as you grow with your camera hobby. This shot is an excellent study in texture and color, and composition.  ', '2007-12-05 22:00:18.000000', NULL, 0),
